<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles quarter-final</p>
<p>results at the Wimbledon tennis championships on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
